<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-TUESDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-TUESDAY'S SCHEDULE OF MATCHES AT THE FRENCH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of matches on show courts at the French Open tennis championships on Tuesday (matches start 0900 GMT)</p>
<p>Centre court</p>
<p>Paola Suarez (Argentina) v 2-Steffi Graf (Germany)</p>
<p>12-Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) v Lori McNeil (U.S.)</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) v Karol Kucera (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) v 4-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia)</p>
<p>Court A</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat (France) v Rene Simpson (Canada)</p>
<p>Jim Courier (U.S.) v Magnus Larsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) v Henrieta Nagyova (Slovakia)</p>
<p>Rodolphe Gilbert (France) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>Court 1</p>
<p>7-Marcelo Rios (Chile) v Wayne Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>Anne-Gaelle Sidot (France) v Larisa Neiland (Latvia)</p>
<p>Karolina Jagieniak (France) v 6-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>6-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) v Scott Draper (Australia)</p>
</text>
